xcutcube.obj
x
xtitle           Simple object - cube with one corner cut off
xdisplay         poly_zsort
xdetail          ~frank/data/hand_built/smpobj.det
xtype            polygon faceted
xbounding_box    -1 1 -1 1 -1 1
xdata   10    7
x  1.0  -1.0  -1.0
x -1.0  -1.0  -1.0
x -1.0  -1.0   0.0
x -0.0  -1.0   1.0
x  1.0  -1.0   1.0
x -1.0  -0.0   1.0
x -1.0   1.0  -1.0
x  1.0   1.0  -1.0
x  1.0   1.0   1.0
x -1.0   1.0   1.0
x       5       1       2       3       4       5
x       4       8       1       5       9
x       4       7       8       9      10
x       5       2       7      10       6       3
x       4       8       7       2       1
x       5       5       4       6      10       9
x       3       3       6       4
xcolor           1 0 1
xshininess       0.5
xtransmittance   0.5 0.5
xvertex_colors  ~glenn/frctl/cube.vcl
